          "wrong": "(Kechirim so'raysiz) 괜찮아요.",
          "right": "죄송합니다.",
          "why_uz": "Kechirim — 죄송합니다; 괜찮아요 — javob.",
          "why_en": "To apologise say 죄송합니다; 괜찮아요 is the reply."
        }
      ],
      "uz_compare": "O'zbekchada 'xayr' bitta. Koreyschada kim ketayotganiga qarab ikki xil: ketayotganga 안녕히 가세요, qolayotganga 안녕히 계세요. 'Yaxshi boring' va 'yaxshi qoling' ga o'xshaydi.",
      "compare_en": "English has one 'goodbye'. Korean picks by who leaves: 안녕히 가세요 to someone leaving ('go well'), 안녕히 계세요 to someone staying ('stay well')."
    },
    {
